  "bodyHash": "900ca3b1550ab08b",
  "content": "<h2><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_672c058d-ffdc-49a1-9ea8-dfd57c7ae91a.png\"></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 这是《我独自升级》漫画/动画系列的Minecraft模组。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 仍在开发中<br><br></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">GeckoLib</span></a>,&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">playerAnimator</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1&showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Cloth ConfigAPI</span></a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>Better Combat</strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>Epic Fight</strong></span></a> 兼容，需搭配 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slr-ef-standart\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">扩展模组</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">替代方案：兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>Epic Fight</strong></span></a> 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slrefextended\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>扩展模组</strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如有任何疑问，请加入 Discord：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/9gw6Tu8Cx9\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>备用 Discord 链接（以防原链接过期）：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/36ejJENP74\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组的工作方式是：你通过击杀怪物获得经验值并升级。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/solo-leveling-arsenal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1340648678163087392/1356719603597705437/67ea7a6533671caab89ba11f_Bild-2025-03-12-194628251.png?ex=67fa1d58&is=67f8cbd8&hm=4aff55acbb65100c8936ada72b5b46eb4aa61cbb5e50daee3ca3fa948d5df1d9&\" width=\"627\" height=\"139\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/solo-leveling-arsenal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1003429/description_512fd30e-bf87-4776-9d75-d610f7cc94d7.png\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\">额外材质包<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1003429/description_feabe52d-8209-456d-89a5-0c2351ef0801.png\" width=\"139\" height=\"139\"></a></span></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f6af5526-9675-47f4-a366-a507135ba421.png\" width=\"235\" height=\"57\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">你拥有“系统”的力量，因此你可以不断升级并提升属性以变得更强！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">属性包括：</p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li>活力 (Vitality)：增加你的最大生命值并减少受到的伤害)</li>\n<li>力量 (Strength)：增加你的攻击强度</li>\n<li>智力 (Intelligence)：增加你的法力容量</li>\n<li>感知 (Sense)：增加闪避攻击的几率以及对周围生物的察觉能力</li>\n<li>敏捷 (Agility)：增加疾跑速度</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a05cd719-06a3-46b9-9fbc-652f4ba6084a.png\" width=\"243\" height=\"35\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">系统中存在每日任务，位于“活跃任务”标签页。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">请务必完成每日任务，否则你将被传送至<strong>惩罚区域</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如果你成功完成每日任务，将获得以下三种奖励之一：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">它们分别是：</p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li>完全恢复 (Full Recovery)：重置疲劳度并将生命值回满，同时移除负面效果</li>\n<li>随机战利品箱 (Random Lootbox)：给予你随机物品&lt;你需要选择此项以推进某些任务。&gt;</li>\n<li>10点技能点 (10 Skill Points)：给予你10点技能点供你在系统中使用</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如果你能在惩罚区域幸存下来，也将获得相同的奖励。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如果你的每日任务变成了<em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">&lt;s&gt;秘密任务!!&lt;/s&gt;</span></em>，请务必小心。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2f570cb6-efec-46f7-bd1a-f85fae644329.png\" width=\"265\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>世界中会生成连接我们世界与其他维度的传送门。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">传送门的大小各不相同，但较大的传送门并不意味着其中包含更危险的副本。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">传送门有时间限制，请小心！<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_90c0e63a-5392-4a15-8854-5c0d2cb14b11.gif\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如果在时间耗尽前未关闭传送门，将会发生<strong>副本突破 (Dungeon Break)</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>许可扩展</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>禁止在服务器中以“付费获胜”的方式直接出售我模组中的物品。</p>\n<p>你可以自由修改此模组，但必须署名原作者，且不允许将修改后的模组出售牟利。</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>模组中包含匕首、剑、重型近战武器、法杖和护甲</strong></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">特别感谢：</span></strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/wagenboi/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wagenboi </a>(</span>协助开发了着色器视觉系统以及<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><a style=\"color:#c2e0f4\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oculus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oculus</a> </span>兼容性<span style=\"color:#eccafa\">)<br></span></strong><strong>-<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/zerotekz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zerotekz</a> (</span>制作了游戏内的纹理，并制作了<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/solo-leveling-arsenal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">兼容材质包</a><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">)</span></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/wyrmworksteam/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">WyrmworksTeam</span></a> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">(</span>为各种模型制作了动画<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">)<br></span></strong><strong>-<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f119%252ft1n-c4n%253fsrsltid%253dAfmBOopCDQlcRko5mmzsusxNqlQuq3a3Okn04CPJkutYKuYkANGjioG-\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">opERR0R</a> (</span>制作了“<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fproducts%252f11890%252fsolocraft-v1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kasaka</a>”、“<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fproducts%252f11365%252fancient-golem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">远古傀儡</a>”、“<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fproducts%252f11423%252fgoblin-burrows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">哥布林/哥布林王</a>”的3D模型<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">)<br></span></strong><strong>-<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Garf (</span>制作了纹理<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">)<br></span></strong><strong>-<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5J5VOhxWs7RcloioZyVKsg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SirMarcus </a>(</span>为现有模型提供了升级实体模型<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">)<br></span></strong><strong>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f27%252fsamusdev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SamusDev </a>(</span>制作了<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fproducts%252f10595%252forc-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">高等/绿色兽人</a>模型<span style=\"color:#3598db\">)<br></span></strong><strong>-<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Nocsy (</span>制作了<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fproducts%252f11141%252fskeleton-pack-boss-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">“骷髅蛮兵、战士、召唤师、头颅”</a>模型的3D模型<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">)</span><br><br>购买模型的来源：</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Kasaka 和 Kasaka 的毒牙：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fproducts%252f11890%252fsolocraft-v1\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mcmodels.net/products/11890/solocraft-v1</a><br>兽人模型（尚未实装）：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fproducts%252f10595%252forc-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mcmodels.net/products/10595/orc-pack</a><br></strong><strong>新剑和匕首：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fproducts%252f8896%252fmega-weapon-bundle\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mcmodels.net/products/8896/mega-weapon-bundle</a><br>骷髅战士、蛮兵、召唤师：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fproducts%252f11141%252fskeleton-pack-boss-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mcmodels.net/products/11141/skeleton-pack-boss-mobs</a><br></strong><strong>副本装饰方块：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fproducts%252f9242%252fdungeon-megapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mcmodels.net/products/9242/dungeon-megapack</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fproducts%252f10122%252fdungeon-decoration-pack-volume-1\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mcmodels.net/products/10122/dungeon-decoration-pack-volume-1</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fproducts%252f10578%252fdungeon-decorations-v2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mcmodels.net/products/10578/dungeon-decorations-v2</a><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>我已经向 mcmodels 支付了所有购买模型的全额费用，并获得了 mcmodels 审核团队允许我在我的模组中使用这些模型的授权。除非有正当理由，否则针对已购买的 mcmodels 模型的下架尝试将被<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">拒绝</span>。</strong></h1>",
